    "_finding": "Two places STRADDLE Loop 410 rather than sitting cleanly inside it, which the geometry test caught. Castle Hills is a small city the loop runs through, so its centroid lands ~250m outside. The Medical Center (geocoded from 7703 Floyd Curl Dr) sits ~1.9km NORTH of the loop — outside it. The video-1 script says the Medical Center is 'inside Loop 410'; the data disagrees, and a map drawn from this file would visibly contradict that line. Flagged for Peter rather than silently fudged."
  },
